# Packages the wheelhouse CI jobs install to build the prebuilt wheels with
# `python -m build --no-isolation`: the frontend plus the setuptools and wheel
# that every pyproject.toml's [build-system] requires. Pinning them here keeps
# the build backend that produces the published wheels hash-verified.
# Consumed by tools/scripts/regenerate-locks.sh.
